.TH "libnvmf_config_conn_get_hostid" 9 "libnvmf_config_conn_get_hostid" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
libnvmf_config_conn_get_hostid \- a connection's host identifier.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "const char *" libnvmf_config_conn_get_hostid
.BI "(const struct libnvmf_config_conn *conn "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "conn" 12
the resolved connection
.SH "RETURN"
borrowed string, or NULL when the configuration leaves the host
identity to the system default (the connect path applies its usual
hostid fallback).
